    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482180/extras/15b6840ac34eb7dc05f70e4175ce7728.avif?t=1750478116\" /></span>After awakening to find herself trapped in a mysterious dream world, Lily is forced to face her past traumas and experiences. Harnessing a unique ability to swap, rotate, and move the environment around her, Lily progresses through the various worlds in a journey of navigating grief and finding herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482180/extras/68c12427873ccd92342c49ac5e634b25.poster.avif?t=1750478116\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482180/extras/68c12427873ccd92342c49ac5e634b25.webm?t=1750478116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482180/extras/68c12427873ccd92342c49ac5e634b25.mp4?t=1750478116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482180/extras/db22f0c3e7013ddf130673f73100d32b.avif?t=1750478116\" /></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompanied by her flying turtle friend, take on the challenges of the mysterious dream worlds together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap, rotate, and move the environment around you to solve puzzles to progress through the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the stunning, hand-drawn visuals that span various, visually distinct worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring the worlds of As I Began to Dream, you are accompanied by a peaceful, almost melancholy soundtrack, featuring over 20 original tracks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482180/extras/3cea5da459d1dd1f2c207c247df7011e.poster.avif?t=1750478116\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482180/extras/3cea5da459d1dd1f2c207c247df7011e.webm?t=1750478116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482180/extras/3cea5da459d1dd1f2c207c247df7011e.mp4?t=1750478116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482180/extras/15b6840ac34eb7dc05f70e4175ce7728.avif?t=1750478116\" /></span>After awakening to find herself trapped in a mysterious dream world, Lily is forced to face her past traumas and experiences. Harnessing a unique ability to swap, rotate, and move the environment around her, Lily progresses through the various worlds in a journey of navigating grief and finding herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482180/extras/68c12427873ccd92342c49ac5e634b25.poster.avif?t=1750478116\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482180/extras/68c12427873ccd92342c49ac5e634b25.webm?t=1750478116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482180/extras/68c12427873ccd92342c49ac5e634b25.mp4?t=1750478116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482180/extras/db22f0c3e7013ddf130673f73100d32b.avif?t=1750478116\" /></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompanied by her flying turtle friend, take on the challenges of the mysterious dream worlds together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap, rotate, and move the environment around you to solve puzzles to progress through the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the stunning, hand-drawn visuals that span various, visually distinct worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring the worlds of As I Began to Dream, you are accompanied by a peaceful, almost melancholy soundtrack, featuring over 20 original tracks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482180/extras/3cea5da459d1dd1f2c207c247df7011e.poster.avif?t=1750478116\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482180/extras/3cea5da459d1dd1f2c207c247df7011e.webm?t=1750478116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482180/extras/3cea5da459d1dd1f2c207c247df7011e.mp4?t=1750478116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
